   "source": [
    "search for packages in conda environment:\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda search <new_environment_name>```\n",
    "\n",
    "- eg: ```conda search \"*scikit*\"```\n",
    "\n",
    "- eg: ```conda search 'numpy>=1.12'```\n",
    "\n",
    "Search for all current user environments\n",
    "\n",
    "```conda search —-envs```\n",
    "\n",
    "Params:\n",
    "- —-envs : search all of current user environments\n"
   ]
